    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8d5339564555d3424daf30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经有种名为『劲敌意识』的东西萌芽了。\r\n『不愿败给劲敌们』的想法，\r\n也在她心中悄悄诞生了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "326e1ed274670c3bdb78750d1e2931537166c7d5063a64ab9393839b06f94085",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
