      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『为了妹妹而献上胜利』。\n对她而言，这是人生中最为重要的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3216c06c69a8280a43e099f005045ec31b12b1e058d911f92b1029e61fbf4b3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
